7
00:00:13,221 --> 00:00:13,579
Senate.

8
00:00:13,979 --> 00:00:15,870
He didn't believe in spirit circles.

9
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,247
So he went to one at the Poston home, to

10
00:00:18,257 --> 00:00:18,955
